&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;You’ll be joining NiCE at a pivotal moment — a reinvigorated brand, an AI-first vision, and a rapidly expanding global presence. Social media plays a critical role in how NiCE communicates innovation and leadership to the market.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About NiCE &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
